The following announcement is from Karen Stein.

Hello everyone!=20

We apologize for anyone who's been unable to join our meeting. Below is a n=
ew link that should work.=20

THE MEETING WILL NOW START OCTOBER 30th!=20

We're trying something different this year for the LLG (Logical Language Gr=
oup)'s annual Members Meeting. Everyone is welcome to join us. The plan is =
for anyone interested to consider and discuss the topics on the agenda in a=
 special group on Mattermost and on the various online lojban chats beginni=
ng today.=20

Anyone may also add topics and proposals to the agenda (see below). When th=
e meeting itself begins the Officers hope we will be able to move through t=
opics more quickly. There will still be some time allocated for further dis=
cussion during the meeting.=20

Another step to increase the pace of the meeting everyone interested can he=
lp by joining the meeting on Mattermost now and announcing your presence. T=
aking attendance has regularly taken longer than it should. Make sure to al=
so say if you are an LLG Member for our records. Thank you!=20

AGENDA:

https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1vKmfbE0HU90zubg8EwYBoAtdZoIo4ubfRVo=
G4W9mF8s/edit?usp=3Ddrivesdk <https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1vKmfb=
E0HU90zubg8EwYBoAtdZoIo4ubfRVoG4W9mF8s/edit?usp=3Ddrivesdk>

MEETING LOGIN:

We use Mattermost through Framateam.=20

In order to join the discussion at Mattermost you'll need to first sign up,=
 if you haven't already.=20

Often entering our team will take you to the signup page, so feel free to t=
ry it.  This is also how to join our meetings and discussions once you have=
 an account.=20

https://framateam.org/signup_user_complete/?id=3D17b4ir6u6by6px693dm8kmy7yw=
 <https://framateam.org/signup_user_complete/?id=3D17b4ir6u6by6px693dm8kmy7=
yw>

RELATED MATTERMOST CHANNELS:

2022 Agenda Discussion
2022 Members Meeting

NOTE:

The interface starts out in French, but once you get inside, you can change=
 the system language to English (or Spanish). Here are a few translations t=
o get you through the sign-up part:

Quelle est votre adresse e-mail ? =3D What's your email address?
Sp=C3=A9cifiez votre nom d'utilisateur =3D Specify your username.
Sp=C3=A9cifiez votre mot de passe =3D Specify your password.
Cr=C3=A9er un compte =3D Create an account.

(special thanks to Mike S for putting this together)

If you have trouble, please email me at GryphKat@gmail.com <mailto:GryphKat=
@gmail.com>.=20

